+# STAGE 4: Exact Criteria & Contract Decisions
+
+**Run ID:** `ER-RUN-LOCALFLOW-20261019-074`
+**Authority:** `OWNER-UPDATE-20261018-019`
+**Definitive Owner Policy Decision:** `OWNER-UPDATE-20261019-001`
